sdata> -- PC-1: Get_Array_Element must raise on a reference to an array that is no
sdata> -- longer defined. Needs REPL (piped stdin) to reach it -- batch mode parses
sdata> -- V(2) before ARRAY V A B C runs, so it's a harmless missing function call.
sdata> ARRAY V A B C
sdata> PRINT V(2)
sdata> ARRAY V
sdata> RUN
Error: Array 'V' not defined.
RUN complete. 1 records and 0 variables processed.
sdata> QUIT
